  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "專業實習(二)",
    "sub_ename": "INTERNSHIP (2)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程為學生提供至產業機構進行實務實習的課程，其目的在加強學生全面了解學術理論與企業實務管理運作之交互關係，以強化學生專業技能，提升未來就業競爭力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course provides prospective students internship opportunities in industrial institutions or firms to learn practically. The purpose is to strengthen students’ comprehensive understanding of the interaction between theories of social business management and practices in the company, and in turn to improve students’ expertise as well as competitiveness in their future career.",
